Project Development Phase
# ComicCraft — AI Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models

 ## Project Development Phase

 The **Development Phase** is where the approved design of ComicCraft is converted into a working application. The focus is on implementing the user interface, Gemini integration, story-generation workflow, project storage, editing features, and comic preview.

 ## 1\. Development Objectives

 The main objectives are to:

 - Build the ComicCraft web application.
- Integrate Gemini models for AI-powered content generation.
- Implement story and character generation.
- Convert stories into scenes and comic panels.
- Generate suitable dialogue and visual descriptions.
- Allow users to edit and regenerate AI-generated content.
- Save and manage comic projects.
- Provide a final comic preview and export capability.

 ## 2\. Proposed Technology Stack

 | Component | Technology |
| --- | --- |
| Frontend | React / Next.js |
| UI Styling | Tailwind CSS |
